    "invariants": [
      "Headers are real keyboard controls: role=button, tabIndex, Enter/Space toggle, aria-expanded + aria-disabled. [at Collapse/engines/modern/index.tsx:17-18]",
      "A collapsed panel's content is aria-hidden AND inert; invisible content never keeps focus or a11y presence. [at Collapse/engines/modern/index.tsx:23]",
      "collapsible='disabled' makes every header inert; collapsible='icon' moves the toggle role to the arrow and the header stops being a control. [at Collapse/engines/modern/index.tsx:15-16]",
      "The arrow glyph is decorative: when it is not the toggle it is aria-hidden, and when it IS the toggle it is named by the header label via aria-labelledby, never by the glyph. [at Collapse/engines/modern/index.tsx:36]",
      "The arrow rotation has exactly one RTL mirror owner (:dir(rtl) scaleX(-1)); a tenant cannot double-mirror it. [at modern/skin/collapse.css:83-98]",
      "Under coarse pointers the header and arrow are floored at the touch-target minimum. [at modern/skin/collapse.css:103-115]",
      "prefers-reduced-motion: reduce forces transitions to 0.01ms !important; a tenant motion dial cannot re-enable motion. [at modern/skin/collapse.css:372-378, Collapse/engines/modern/index.tsx:75]",
      "forced-colors: active pins outline/color/border-color to system keywords (Highlight, GrayText, ButtonText). [at modern/skin/collapse.css:356-368]"
    ],
